      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your components become incredibly clean:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-154",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
